    {
      "label": {
        "en": [
          "About"
        ]
      },
      "value": {
        "en": [
          "<p>This map reveals key points on the ship Bedford's second translatlantic voyage trafficking enslaved African people. The voyage took place between 1805 and 1805, and we have used a map from 1719 to visualise the route.</p> <p>To navigate through the story, click the text on the right hand side.</p>"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "label": {
        "en": [
          "Content warning"
        ]
      },
      "value": {
        "en": [
          "This resource covers sensitive topics and should be approached with care. It includes quotes from material that contains dehumanising and distressing descriptions of enslavement. "
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "label": {
        "en": [
          "Catalogue reference"
        ]
      },
      "value": {
        "en": [
          "The resource was created using the following collection of records. The National Archives: C 114/158; T 71/119; T 71/65 and T 71/164."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
